Package: onepagr
Title: Accessible One-Page Reports from 'Typst' Templates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Andrew", "Farrey", email = "afarrey11@outlook.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(affiliation = "University of Kentucky, Kentucky Injury Prevention and Research Center",
        ORCID = "0000-0003-4279-0998")),
    person("Microsoft Corporation", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
    comment = "Fluent System Icons glyph in the hex logo; see inst/COPYRIGHTS"))
Description: Generates polished, accessible one-page (front-and-back) Portable
    Document Format (PDF) reports from analysis output, conforming to the
    Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 level AA and the
    Portable Document Format Universal Accessibility standard (PDF/UA-1,
    ISO 14289-1). Uses a small set of fixed 'Typst' report templates and a
    design-token theme system. Ships built-in report templates and themes,
    and lets a consuming project replace them with its own design tokens
    and 'Typst' templates.
SystemRequirements: Quarto (<https://quarto.org>), which bundles Typst 0.15.1
    or newer
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/andrew-farrey/onepagr
